":"2026-11-02T18:27:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50359564/alabama-optimistic-return-key-starters-lsu-showdown","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Alabama without Zabien Brown, EJ Crowell, Racin Delgatty vs. Texas A&M","description":"Alabama will be without starting cornerback Zabien Brown, tailback EJ Crowell and center Racin Delgatty when it tries to end a two-game losing streak against Texas A&M.","published":"2026-10-24T19:15:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50267995/alabama-cb-brown-rb-crowell-c-delgatty-vs-texas-am","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-15T04:25:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Louisville holds off UNC in game that ends with brawl","description":"Louisville held off North Carolina 16-14 on Saturday night in a game that ended in a brawl and each of the teams having to be separated.","published":"2026-11-15T04:28:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486992/louisville-holds-unc-game-ends-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kentucky's CFP hopes take hit in upset loss to Gators, Philo","description":"Florida quarterback Aaron Philo had 221 all-purpose yards and a touchdown to rally the Gators past No. 11 Kentucky 21-14 Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T04:13:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486400/kentucky-cfp-hopes-take-hit-upset-loss-gators-philo","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 24 Boise State outlasts Oregon State, to host Pac-12 title game","description":"Rasean Jones caught 11 passes for 230 yards and 3 TDs to help No. 24 Boise State outlast Oregon State 46-41 and wrap up the host spot in the Pac-12 title game.","published":"2026-11-15T03:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486399/boise-state-outlasts-oregon-state-host-pac-12-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 16 Oregon keeps CFP hopes alive with win over Michigan","description":"Dylan Raiola threw for 341 yards and four touchdowns, and No. 16 Oregon kept its slim chances for a spot in the College Football Playoff alive with a victory over struggling Michigan on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:15:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485510/no16-oregon-keeps-cfp-hopes-alive-win-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest's post-blowout jab at SMU tops college football Week 11 trolls","description":"Wake Forest dominated SMU on the gridiron Saturday -- and added insult to injury after the game.","published":"2026-11-15T00:54:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481104/college-football-trolls-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Grant Wilson delivers as Indiana boosts CFP, Big Ten hopes with win vs. USC","description":"With Grant Wilson filling in at quarterback, No. 9 Indiana ramped up its offensive attack against USC and scored its best win of the season Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:22:32.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485076/grant-wilson-indiana-boost-cfp-big-ten-hopes-win-vs-usc","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Watch best moments and top plays live from Week 11","published":"2026-11-15T01:00:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50474063/week-11-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079344/zabien-brown","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zabien_Brown"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Zabien Brown","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zabien_Brown","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:26Z","intro":"Zabien Brown (born November 7, 2004) is an American college football cornerback for the Alabama Crimson Tide.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Brown attended Mater Dei High School in Santa Ana, California. As a junior, he notched 32 tackles, three interceptions, and a forced fumble. Coming out of high school, Brown was rated as a four-star recruit and the seventh-ranked cornerback in the class of 2024. He committed to play college football for the Alabama Crimson Tide over offers from California, Georgia, Ohio State, and USC."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Heading into the 2024 season, Brown competed for one of the Alabama starting defensive back positions. In his first collegiate game, he made the start for the Crimson Tide where he allowed no receptions in a win over Western Kentucky. In week 5, Brown had the game-winning interception, as he helped the Crimson Tide upset their rivals Georgia 41–34. In 2025, Brown returned an interception 99 yards for a touchdown against the Tennessee Volunteers at the end of the first half, ultimately helping Alabama seal a 37-20 victory. Brown returned another interception for a pivotal pick six touchdown against Oklahoma in the first round of the College Football Playoff."}]}}